    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face hordes of ghosts in Ghost Ascension!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up</h2>Over 50 unique abilities to create the combinations you wish!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/fea394a4f0beea878e42e1ed40c22487.poster.avif?t=1718719883\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/fea394a4f0beea878e42e1ed40c22487.webm?t=1718719883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/fea394a4f0beea878e42e1ed40c22487.mp4?t=1718719883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Tree</h2>Permanent skill tree to speed up your progress!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/afdbc4222d5415796e2f788360f9b1b3.poster.avif?t=1718719883\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/afdbc4222d5415796e2f788360f9b1b3.webm?t=1718719883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/afdbc4222d5415796e2f788360f9b1b3.mp4?t=1718719883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascensions</h2>Combine abilities of the same class to unlock a new, powerful ascension!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818830/extras/4e792aa31c9a48c10da72b40c6ec0563.poster.avif?t=1718719883\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co